    "title": "Capacity To Ship Packages Within D Days",
    "category": "Binary Search",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array weights where weights[i] is the weight of the i-th package and an integer days, determine the least weight capacity of a ship that will allow all packages to be shipped within exactly days days. Packages must be shipped in the given order.",
